{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/10058","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:55:52.702156+00:00","comments":[],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"MEMBER","body":"### What happened?\n\nfrom @nicolasvasilache when working on https://github.com/iree-org/iree/pull/9744:\r\n```\r\n./build/tools/iree-compile ./compiler/transform_dialect/gpu/reduction/reduction.mlir -iree-hal-target-backends=cuda  --iree-flow-dispatch-use-transform-dialect=compiler/transform_dialect/gpu/reduction/transform_dialect_dispatch_spec.mlir --iree-codegen-llvmgpu-use-transform-dialect=compiler/transform_dialect/gpu/reduction/transform_dialect_codegen_spec.mlir |  ./build/tools/iree-run-module --entry_function=reduce\r\nReading module contents from stdin...\r\nEXEC @reduce\r\niree-run-module: iree/runtime/src/iree/task/task.c:107: void iree_task_discard(iree_task_t *, iree_task_list_t *): Assertion `((0)==(__c11_atomic_load((&task->pending_dependency_count), (iree_memory_order_acquire))))' failed.\r\nAborted\r\n```\r\n\r\nI tried to repro and got something different:\r\n```\r\nλ ..\\iree-build\\tools\\iree-compile.exe ./samples/models/simple_abs.mlir --iree-hal-target-backends=cuda | ..\\iree-build\\tools\\iree-run-module.exe --entry_function=abs --function_input=f32=-5.0\r\nReading module contents from stdin...\r\nEXEC @abs\r\n<vm>:0: UNKNOWN; device not supported in the compiled configuration;\r\n[ 0] bytecode module.abs:310 ./samples/models/simple_abs.mlir:2:13\r\n      at ./samples/models/simple_abs.mlir:1:1; invoking function 'abs'\r\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce your issue\n\n1. compile for CUDA (and maybe other targets) using `iree-compile`\r\n2. run using `iree-run-module` without passing `--device=cuda`\r\n3. observe assert instead of a nice error message\r\n\r\nThis might depend on compilation flags used, like `-DIREE_ENABLE_ASSERTIONS=ON` or debug/relwithdebinfo/release.\n\n### What component(s) does this issue relate to?\n\nRuntime\n\n### Version information\n\nhttps://github.com/nicolasvasilache/iree/commit/66c0ea35fb10436721403ffd63441e0bac36f349\n\n### Additional context\n\nPassing `--device=cuda` works:\r\n\r\n```\r\n./build/tools/iree-compile ./compiler/transform_dialect/gpu/reduction/reduction.mlir -iree-hal-target-backends=cuda  --iree-flow-dispatch-use-transform-dialect=compiler/transform_dialect/gpu/reduction/transform_dialect_dispatch_spec.mlir --iree-codegen-llvmgpu-use-transform-dialect=compiler/transform_dialect/gpu/reduction/transform_dialect_codegen_spec.mlir |  ./build/tools/iree-run-module --entry_function=reduce --device=cuda\r\nReading module contents from stdin...\r\nEXEC @reduce\r\nresult[0]: hal.buffer_view\r\n8xf32=64 64 64 64 64 64 64 64\r\n```","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/10058/comments","created_at":"2022-08-10T23:06:50Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/10058/events","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/10058","id":1335295613,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":false,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1553038945,"name":"bug 🐞","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTUzMDM4OTQ1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/labels/bug%20%F0%9F%90%9E"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"ecff60","default":false,"description":"IREE's runtime tooling (iree-run-module, iree-benchmark-module, etc)","id":2524563629,"name":"runtime/tools","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNTI0NTYzNjI5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/labels/runtime/tools"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"76b900","default":false,"description":"Runtime CUDA HAL backend","id":2695975218,"name":"hal/cuda","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjk1OTc1MjE4","url":"https://api.github.co